&lt;-7&gt; à 10 x 10&lt;-7&gt;/ DEG C, et contient au moins 0,28/mm de  beta -OH. De préférence, le rapport en poids de la teneur en Li2O-Al2O3 et en SiO2 satisfait la relation 0,058 &gt;/= {Li2O/(SiO2 + Al2O3)} &gt;/= 0,031.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>